   "text": "# VLABench",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 1936,
   "end": 2575,
   "text": "[VLABench](⟦0⟧) is a large-scale benchmark for **language-conditioned robotic manipulation with long-horizon reasoning**. The upstream suite covers 100 task categories across 2,000+ objects and evaluates six dimensions of robot intelligence: mesh & texture understanding, spatial reasoning, world-knowledge transfer, semantic instruction comprehension, physical-law understanding, and long-horizon planning. Built on MuJoCo / dm_control with a Franka Panda 7-DOF arm. LeRobot exposes **43 of these tasks** through ⟦1⟧ (21 primitives + 22 composites, see [Available tasks](⟦2⟧) below).",
   "tokens": [
    "https://github.com/OpenMOSS/VLABench",
    "`--env.task`",
    "#available-tasks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2577,
   "end": 2730,
   "text": "- Paper: [VLABench: A Large-Scale Benchmark for Language-Conditioned Robotics Manipulation with Long-Horizon Reasoning](⟦0⟧)",
   "tokens": [
    "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.18194"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2731,
   "end": 2798,
   "text": "- GitHub: [OpenMOSS/VLABench](⟦0⟧)",
   "tokens": [
    "https://github.com/OpenMOSS/VLABench"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2799,
   "end": 2866,
   "text": "- Project website: [vlabench.github.io](⟦0⟧)",
   "tokens": [
    "https://vlabench.github.io"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2867,
   "end": 2965,
   "text": "- Pretrained policy: [⟦0⟧](⟦1⟧)",
   "tokens": [
    "`lerobot/smolvla_vlabench`",
    "https://huggingface.co/lerobot/smolvla_vlabench"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3133,
   "end": 3151,
   "text": "## Available tasks",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3153,
   "end": 3250,
   "text": "VLABench ships two task suites covering **43 task categories** in LeRobot's ⟦0⟧ surface:",
   "tokens": [
    "`--env.task`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 3252,
   "end": 3354,
   "text": "| Suite     | CLI name    | Tasks | Description                                                      |",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "kind": "table",
   "start": 3458,
   "end": 3560,
   "text": "| Primitive | ⟦0⟧ | 21    | Single / few-skill combinations (select, insert, physics QA)     |",
   "tokens": [
    "`primitive`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
