   "text": "| Composite | ⟦0⟧ | 22    | Multi-step reasoning and long-horizon planning (cook, rearrange) |",
   "tokens": [
    "`composite`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 3665,
